      Title: Baked Ziti
 Categories: Pasta
      Yield: 0 Servings

      2 Onion -- minced
      2 Garlic -- Minced
      1    Carrot -- Diced Fine
      1 Celery -- Diced Fine
      4 Hot Italian Sausage
      1 Salt & pepper
      1 Dried Oregano
    1/4 Fresh parsley -- chopped
    1/2 Wine - Red
      1 Tomatoes -- chopped

Brown the sausage in a heavy pan, then slice it into rounds. Simmer the sauce and bake at 350° for 30 minutes.

Enjoy!
Test Kitchen 2020

