MMMMM----- Recipe via Meal-Master (from JavaRecipes)

      Title: Layered Pasta Bake
 Categories: Pasta
      Yield: 0 Servings

               === WHITE SAUCE ===
      3  c Hot milk
      6 tb Butter
      6 tb Flour
    1/2 ts Salt
               === MEAT SAUCE ===
      1 lb Ground beef
      1 sm Onion -- chopped
      2  c Crushed tomatoes
           Salt -- to taste
               === PASTA ===
     12    Lasagna sheets
      1  c Grated parmesan

Make the white sauce, then the meat sauce. Layer with the pasta and bake at 375° for 40 minutes.

Notes:
  "Freezes well"
Yield:
  8 Servings"
S("Cuisine")
  "Italian"

